      "text": "Cochinchina (disambiguation)\nCochinchina may refer to : Cochinchina , a historical name used in the West for the southern part of Vietnam , referring either to the area of Danang , or to \u0110\u00e0ng Trong , or more generally to the territory ruled by the Nguy\u1ec5n lords French Cochinchina , the southernmost part of French Indochina"
